    "text": "This is a greedy event-driven heuristic. It repeatedly takes the vehicle that becomes free earliest and assigns it the unassigned ride with the best points-per-step ratio among rides it can still finish on time. A vehicle with no feasible ride left is dropped, since waiting only makes later rides harder to reach. The work is at most about N\u00b2 = 10\u2078 simple operations, well within the limits. I have not compiled or run it against the official data sets, so the score is unverified.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    ios_strings_dummy:;\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n\n    long long R, C, F, N, B, T;\n    cin >> R >> C >> F >> N >> B >> T;\n\n    vector<long long> a(N), b(N), x(N), y(N), s(N), f(N), dist(N);\n    for (int i = 0; i < N; ++i) {\n        cin >> a[i] >> b[i] >> x[i] >> y[i] >> s[i] >> f[i];\n        dist[i] = llabs(a[i] - x[i]) + llabs(b[i] - y[i]);\n    }\n\n    vector<int> active(N);\n    for (int i = 0; i < N; ++i) active[i] = i;\n\n    vector<long long> px(F, 0), py(F, 0);\n    vector<vector<int>> assign(F);\n\n    // min-heap of (free time, vehicle)\n    priority_queue<pair<long long, int>, vector<pair<long long, int>>,\n                   greater<pair<long long, int>>> pq;\n    for (int v = 0; v < F; ++v) pq.push({0LL, v});\n\n    while (!pq.empty() && !active.empty()) {\n        auto [t, v] = pq.top();\n        pq.pop();\n\n        int bestK = -1;\n        double bestVal = -1.0;\n        long long bestFin = 0;\n\n        for (int k = 0; k < (int)active.size(); ++k) {\n            int r = active[k];\n            long long d = llabs(px[v] - a[r]) + llabs(py[v] - b[r]);\n            long long st = max(t + d, s[r]);\n            long long fin = st + dist[r];\n            if (fin > f[r]) continue;\n            long long bonus = (st == s[r]) ? B : 0;\n            double val = (double)(dist[r] + bonus) / (double)(fin - t);\n            if (val > bestVal) {\n                bestVal = val;\n                bestK = k;\n                bestFin = fin;\n            }\n        }\n\n        if (bestK < 0) continue; // vehicle cannot do any more rides\n\n        int r = active[bestK];\n        active[bestK] = active.back();\n        active.pop_back();\n\n        assign[v].push_back(r);\n        px[v] = x[r];\n        py[v] = y[r];\n        pq.push({bestFin, v});\n    }\n\n    string out;\n    out.reserve(1 << 20);\n    for (int v = 0; v < F; ++v) {\n        out += to_string(assign[v].size());\n        for (int r : assign[v]) {\n            out += ' ';\n            out += to_string(r);\n        }\n        out += '\\n';\n    }\n    cout << out;\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
